		(at -33.13 -9.1 180)
		(descr "SMA female jack, straight, PCB edge mount for 1.6 mm boards (KooingTech SMA-KE, generic SMA-KE 4-leg type). Built from the generic SMA-KE dimension drawing: legs 4 mm long, 0.9 wide, 4.2 mm gap (6.0 outer), PCB slot 1.7, centre pin 0.8 mm, flange 6.5 x 6.5 x 1.5, barrel 1/4-36UNS 8 mm, overall 13.5 mm. Origin = board edge at the RF pin (pads end 0.25 mm before the edge, the flange sits on the edge); RF pad and two ground pads on the top layer, two ground pads on the bottom layer. NOT taken from a KooingTech drawing: check the pad pattern against your part before ordering.")
